WEBVTT

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.470
NARRATOR:
In the end,

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.807
Charlie Bucket
won a chocolate factory,

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:21.896
but Willy Wonka
got something even better--

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.817
a family.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:30.530
And one thing
was absolutely certain:

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:35.118
life had never been sweeter.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:39.664
Captioning sponsored by
WARNER BROS.

